-- FLAG SYSTEM:
--   Every Toggle, Slider, Input, Dropdown, and Keybind has a "Flag" field.
--   The Flag is a unique string that identifies that element in the save file.
--   Make sure every Flag is DIFFERENT or they will overwrite each other!
--   Example: Flag = "MyScript_AutoFarm"
--
-- AUTO-SAVE:
--   All flags are automatically saved to "AsaiyaHub_Config.json" on your executor.
--   When you re-execute, all saved values are restored and callbacks are re-fired.
--   Buttons and Sections do NOT save (they don't have state).

